	(text "MAINS IO. Relays K101-K104 switch MAINS_L to NO; link L-COM with a wire in the terminal for switched-live, or leave open for volt-free. Gate pull-downs keep every relay OFF through reset/brownout."
		(at 30 30 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2778b65d-bdc6-4f78-a940-8cddedfbb26b")
	)
	(text "230V SENSE INPUTS: 6 x 22k 1206 chain (~1.7mA, ~420V impulse per part) -> LTV-817S LED with antiparallel diode. Output is ACTIVE-LOW when live present (inverted: true in ESPHome). ES1-3 return via MAINS_N. DEMAND: use 230V or 24V input with its own RET. MAINS_OK senses board L."
		(at 30 145 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
